  "as_of": "2022-09-07",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would change income and assets testing for pensioners and other eligible income support recipients selling their principal home and preparing to obtain another.",
   "It would extend the usual assets test exemption for earmarked sale proceeds from 12 to 24 months and apply only the lower deeming rate.",
   "The rules would cover social security and veterans’ payments, with a further extension available in particular circumstances and commencement subject to the bill’s timing provisions."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Exempt home sale proceeds would be assessed separately from other financial assets when calculating deemed income.",
   "The maximum extended exemption would increase from 24 to 36 months.",
   "Commencement would be the later of 1 January 2023 or one month after royal assent."
  ],
  "affected": "Pensioners, eligible income support recipients, their partners and administrators of social security and veterans’ payments would be affected.",
